{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-98","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"The square on a first apotome of a medial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth a second apotome.","book":10,"number":98,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.98","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.98/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":98,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","contentId":"euclid-10-98","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d038e5e4ac443a3b13ba8f75ab81f2d4a141c6794002592e1377f566e7a4a15","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-98.statement","euclid-10-98.construction.1","euclid-10-98.construction.2","euclid-10-98.proof.1","euclid-10-98.proof.2","euclid-10-98.proof.3","euclid-10-98.proof.4","euclid-10-98.proof.5","euclid-10-98.proof.6","euclid-10-98.proof.7","euclid-10-98.proof.8","euclid-10-98.proof.9","euclid-10-98.construction.3","euclid-10-98.proof.10","euclid-10-98.proof.11","euclid-10-98.proof.12","euclid-10-98.proof.13","euclid-10-98.conclusion","euclid-10-98.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-98.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c517b536fb0d94253c85998feddf64201ea35c19ac5e35e7018adecc64badbb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on a first apotome of a medial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth a second apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"中项无理线段生产中,头截差无理线段的正方形适用于有理线段生产的宽度为第二截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"166bf99159c330ad0d26b3a8a046bbd318601ebbb606e01e44084c5012510988","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a first apotome of a medial straight line and CD a rational straight line, and to CD let there be applied CE equal to the square on AB, producing CF as breadth; I say that CF is a second apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是中项无理线段和CD是有理线段中的第1 截差无理线段,CD是AB,CE等于AB的正方形,宽度扩大为CF;我说CF是第二截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed4d9396a53d90e537035fbc374480b62b4989d550286fafe518378fd9623ed6","citations":["euclid-10-74"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BG be the annex to AB;. therefore AG, GB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a rational rectangle. [[X. 74](/principles/euclid-10-74)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG是AB的附件,因此AG,GB是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,包含有理,矩形。 [[X. 74](/principles/euclid-10-74)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"718a9ed527dc1fa3ce50bf287cb8d403f142740d2fa8b9e21dc703e08704f0d5","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To CD let there be applied CH equal to the square on AG, producing CK as breadth, and KL equal to the square on GB, producing KM as breadth; therefore the whole CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB; therefore CL is also medial. [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CD应适用CH,相当于正方形,AG,宽度CK,宽度GB,宽度正方形;CL,宽度KM,等于正方形;因此,CL,宽度AG,GB,等于正方形;因此,CL,宽度中项无理线段。（相关点与线段：KL） [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1dbe2585cb12021da756cd4fab93bfa8325b874e66a99b95c3224f1f6d5993c6","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line CD, producing CM as breadth; therefore CM is rational and incommensurable in length with CD. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到CM宽,因此,CM长为有理,不可公度长为CD。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"191c56d1803f4f4f396766cd5c701489f2bfe7e0323abb66e9454f2f6df7cf4d","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and, in these, the square on AB is equal to CE, therefore the remainder, twice the rectangle AG, GB, is equal to FL. [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,CL等于AG,GB,其中AB等于CE,因此其余等于矩形,AG,GB的两倍等于FL。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f0dbe646aef254b0b093a60d8d41467e1f2159c85266d7aca8ecc073bf4366a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But twice the rectangle AG, GB is rational; therefore FL is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但矩形 AG,GB是有理的两倍,FL是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25caa70dddb46c47137d5611bc173ce9aaba7c527248e93f2502654e91f78aca","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line FE, producing FM as breadth; therefore FM is also rational and commensurable in length with CD. [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到FM宽,因此,FM宽也为有理宽,长度可公度宽CD宽。（相关点与线段：FE） [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"614d9fa617faf2fb330728c51c93098895f88ee4a52364338fbd216ddb36084d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the sum of the squares on AG, GB, that is, CL, is medial, while twice the rectangle AG, GB, that is, FL, is rational, therefore CL is incommensurable with FL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 AG 与 GB 的平方和，即 CL，是中项无理量，而以 AG、GB 为边的矩形面积的两倍，即 FL，是有理量，所以 CL 与 FL 不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9705ddc987e2038c0c99aab170fb36ca66f335c37cc7cdad6560044081a0698","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CL is to FL, so is CM to FM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CM is incommensurable in length with FM. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CL比FL等于CM比FM,因此,CM比CL等于FM；CL 与 FL 之比等于 CM 与 FM 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9689d66c63909b8fca33480f6a6e8446452b520ecf2c95b52eb0af220454a2f","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore CM, MF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore CF is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,CM,MF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,CF是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54bd8990425dd6f997fa5731b780d09c5ce387cce69b125eb587d95d8b30931e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a second apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第二个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":12,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"97dfc0425a77cc8ad60f7d831e23a0465f8497ed7680a40e8cc1a47d286082dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let FM be bisected at N, and let NO be drawn through N parallel to CD; therefore each of the rectangles FO, NL is equal to the rectangle AG, GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FM两部分为N,NO在N之间划线,CD线平行;因此,矩形FONL每件等于矩形AGGB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df1374a4532733a71635ac04bbcb57fe8bebf157b12ebfd735a1271c63cd4a85","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the rectangle AG, GB is a mean proportional between the squares on AG, GB, and the square on AG is equal to CH, the rectangle AG, GB to NL, and the square on BG to KL, therefore NL is also a mean proportional between CH, KL; therefore, as CH is to NL, so is NL to KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于矩形 AG,GB是比例中项,GB是比例中项,AG是正方形,正方形是CH,矩形 AG,GB至NL,正方形是BG至KL,NL,NL也是比例中项,CH和KL,CH和NL,CH是AG,NL,NL是NL；CH 与 NL 之比等于 NL 与 KL 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba2cfc75f73ff2e7c90cc8c8f5c3ee6e5e1317741e1bb973501e03b2706f2f17","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CH is to NL, so is CK to NM, and, as NL is to KL, so is NM to MK; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore, as CK is to NM, so is NM, so is KM; [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore the rectangle CK, KM is equal to the square on NM [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)], that is, to the fourth part of the square on FM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CH对NL的比等于CK对NM的比,NL对KL的比等于NM对MK的比;因此,CK对NM的比等于NM,KM的比等于NM;因此,矩形对CK、KM的比等于NM对正方形的比,即正方形对FM的比为正方形的第四部分；CH 与 NL 之比等于 CK 与 NM 之比；NL 与 KL 之比等于 NM 与 MK 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"17ab02278d610ff67b43f15bdc4a8ef45ce533b159099d9e6a1e0cd1e681f97d","citations":["euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since the CM, MF are two unequal straight lines, and the rectangle CK, KM equal to the fourth part of the square on MF and deficient by a square figure has been applied to the greater, CM, and divides it into commensurable parts, therefore the square on CM is greater than the square on MF by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with CM. [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于CM线,MF线是两条不平等的直线,矩形CKCKKM等于MF正方形4号4,有正方形个不足的数字被应用于较大的CMKM,并分成可公度个部分,因此,CM正方形CM正方形比MF正方形长度可公度CM正方形长度可公度CM长度可公度正方形CM。 [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"15b164ddad264a094f0be70b7aaaa6a8ace7e42bdd49d6dd704f50f1f5e1b1b7","citations":["euclid-10-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the annex FM is commensurable in length with the rational straight line CD set out; therefore CF is a second apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"附件FM是长度可公度,有理线段 CD已经写好,因此,CF是第二个截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":17,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-98.source","contentId":"euclid-10-98","revisionId":"euclid-10-98@raw-2d038e5e4ac443a3","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6e2e5c0afe87334d6ffe0b5b217c9f8f59482b6d16b80c6f5aec434c728fe2a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.98/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.98\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10